x; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.06; letter-spacing:-0.03em; margin:0 0 18px; text-wrap:balance;">Automotive PCBA on IATF 16949 qualified lines</h1><p style="font-size:16px; color:var(--ink-2); line-height:1.65; margin:0; text-wrap:pretty;">Hana assembles body control modules, gateway ECUs, sensor interface boards and other automotive electronics on IATF 16949 lines, with PPAP and APQP discipline, board-level traceability, AOI and X-ray inspection.</p></div><div style="position:relative; overflow:hidden; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid var(--line); height:300px; background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,transparent 0 13px,rgba(18,131,221,0.06) 13px 14px);"><img src="/images/photos/mk-automotive-pcba-hero.webp" alt="Automotive PCBA on an SMT line" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div></div></div><div style="position:relative; z-index:1; padding:10px 48px; max-width:976px;"><div class="auto-spec"><div class="cell"><div class="l">QMS</div><div class="v long">IATF 16949</div></div><div class="cell"><div class="l">Process</div><div class="v long">Fine-pitch SMT</div></div><div class="cell"><div class="l">Inspection</div><div class="v long">AOI · X-ray</div></div><div class="cell"><div class="l">Traceability</div><div class="v long">Board-level</div></div></div></div><div style="position:relative; z-index:1; padding:20px 48px; max-width:976px;"><div class="auto-sechead"><h2>The capability behind automotive pcba</h2><p>Automotive PCBA programs use Hana's broader PCBA and box-build processes, with automotive quality-system requirements integrated into the manufacturing flow.</p></div><div style="border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius-card); background:#fff; padding:28px 30px;"><h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:21px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:-0.01em; margin:0 0 12px;">Built on Hana's PCBA &amp; Box Build capability</h3><p style="font-size:14px; color:var(--ink-2); line-height:1.65; margin:0 0 20px; max-width:560px;">Automotive PCBA is manufactured using Hana's SMT, inspection and test processes, supported by IATF 16949 controls, PPAP documentation and material traceability.</p><a href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build" style="font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--hana-blue); text-decoration:none; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;">See PCBA &amp; Box Build <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div><div style="background:#071f35; border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:40px 0;"><div style="max-width:976px; padding:0 48px;"><div class="auto-sechead on-dark"><h2>Where it&#39;s made</h2><p>Automotive PCBA is supported across Thailand, China and Cambodia, providing options for multi-site qualification and supply continuity.</p></div><div class="auto-plants" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);"><a class="auto-plantcard" href="/locations/lamphun" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;"><div><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Thailand</span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div></div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="auto-plantcard" href="/locations/jiaxing" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;"><div><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> China</span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div></div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="auto-plantcard" href="/locations/koh-kong" style="text-decoration:none; color:inherit;"><div><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Cambodia</span><div class="nm">Koh Kong</div></div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span><