x; padding-top:18px; border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/automotive" style="font-size:12px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.07em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--hana-blue); text-decoration:none; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;"><i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Automotive market hub</a></div></div></div></main></div><section class="auto-cta" style="background:var(--hana-blue-deep);" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-accent="cyan" data-fade="none"><div class="inner"><div><h2>Have an automotive board to build?</h2><p>Send a BOM and target volumes. We'll come back with a DFM read and an indicative plan.</p></div><div class="actions"><a href="/contact" class="auto-btn auto-btn--ondark-primary">Start a program <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div>

